    rdfs:label "Protein Q02750" ;
    core:domainOrderText "INTERPRO:IPR000719" ;
    core:proteinSubcellularLocationText "Cytoplasm, cytoskeleton, microtubule organizing center, centrosome {ECO:0000269|PubMed:14737111}. Cytoplasm, cytoskeleton, microtubule organizing center, spindle pole body {ECO:0000269|PubMed:14737111}. Cytoplasm {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10409742, ECO:0000269|PubMed:17101779}. Nucleus {ECO:0000269|PubMed:17101779}. Membrane {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10409742}; Peripheral membrane protein {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10409742}. Note=Localizes at centrosomes during prometaphase, midzone during anaphase and midbody during telophase/cytokinesis (PubMed:14737111). Membrane localization is probably regulated by its interaction with KSR1 (PubMed:10409742). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10409742, ECO:0000269|PubMed:14737111}." .

